# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: part of the TORCS tracks pack.
Package: TORCS-Tracks-DirtOval
Section: Games
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-torcs
Environment: any
Depends: TORCS
Description: Dirt and oval tracks for TORCS
 Tracks for TORCS 1.3.7: dirt-1, dirt-2, dirt-3, dirt-5, dirt-6,
 mixed-1, c-speedway, d-speedway, e-speedway, e-track-5, f-speedway,
 g-speedway, michigan. They go into TORCS's tracks directory and appear
 in Configure Race. Install TORCS-Tracks to get all 29 extra tracks at
 once.
